.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
API-compatibility wrapper for Python's OpenSSL wrapped socket object\&.

Note: _makefile_refs, _drop(), and _reuse() are needed for the garbage
collector of PyPy\&.

.fi
.PP
 
